  "notes": [
    "**Querer** is irregular",
    "Present: stem change e→ie (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: completely irregular stem \"quis-\"",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern based on infinitive stem \"quer-\"",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **querido**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"querr-\" (not \"querer-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"querr-\" + conditional endings",
    "Meaning varies by context: \"to want\" (things/actions) or \"to love\" (people)",
    "Common usage: *Quiero café* (I want coffee), *Te quiero* (I love you)",
    "Related noun: **el querido/la querida** (dear one, beloved)"
